      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinya ndio atu arioterya kudzenga luphya ukuta na maryango ga Jerusalemu. Eliashibu, mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu, na alavyadzi-sadaka ayae adzenga Ryango ra Mangʼondzi na achiritiya miryangoye. Aritenga kpwa ajili ya Mwenyezi Mlungu phamwenga na nyo ukuta hadi kufikira Mnara wa Gana",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gana",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ni dzina ra mnara ko Iziraeli.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na wa Hananeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seemu ya ukuta yolungira yarekebishwa ni atu a Jeriko na iriyolungira hino, yarekebishwa ni Zakuri mwana wa Imuri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ryango ra Ngʼonda rarekebishwa ni atu a mryango wa Hasenaa. Aika mimo na achiimisa miryango, achiitiya tumbuu na magbwamage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seemu ya ukuta yolungira, yarekebishwa ni Meremothi, mwana wa Uriya, mdzukulu wa Hakozi. Seemu ya ukuta yolungira yarekebishwa ni Meshulamu, mwana wa Berekiya, mdzukulu wa Meshezabeli, seemu yolungira yarekebishwa ni Sadoki mwana wa Baana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seemu yolungira yadzengbwa ni atu a Tekoa, ela akulu aho arema kuhenda kazi arizopangirwa ni aimirizi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ryango ra Jeshana radzengbwa ni Joyada, mwana wa Pasea na Meshulamu, mwana wa Besodeya. Aika mimo na achiimisa miryango, achiitiya tumbuu na magbwamage ga kufungira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seemu ya ukuta yolungira yarekebishwa ni Melatia wa kula Gibioni, Jadoni wa kula Meronothi na atu a kula Gibioni na Mizipa, ambako liwali wa jimbo ririro ngʼambo ya muho Yufurati kala anaishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seemu yolungira yarekebishwa ni Uzieli mwana wa Harihaya, yekala mfuli wa zahabu, na Hanania mmwenga wa atengezadzi a manukato, warekebisha seemu ya ukuta iriyolungira. Aha adzenga ukuta wa Jerusalemu hadi kufikira Ukuta Mpana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seemu yolungira yarekebishwa ni Refaya mwana wa Huri, yekala chilongozi wa nusu wilaya ya Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seemu ya ukuta yolungizira yarekebishwa ni Jedaya mwana wa Harumafu, seemu iyo kala i mbere ya nyumbaye. Seemu yolungira yarekebishwa ni Hatushi, mwana wa Hashabuneya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seemu ya ukuta yolungira yarekebishwa ni Malikija mwana wa Harimu phamwenga na Hashubu mwana wa Pahathi-Moabu. Na piya achirekebisha Mnara wa Tanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seemu yolungira yarekebishwa ni Shalumu, mwana wa Haloheshi, liwali wa nusu ya phiri ya wilaya ya Jerusalemu. Hiyu waterywa kurekebisha ukuta ni anae achetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
