          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seemu yolungira kula Dzulu ya Ryango ra Farasi, yarekebishwa ni alavyadzi-sadaka, chila mmwenga warekebisha seemu iriyokala i mbere ya nyumbaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seemu yolungira yarekebishwa ni Sadoki mwana wa Imeri, nayo kala i mbere ya nyumbaye. Seemu yolungira yarekebishwa ni Shemaya mwana wa Shekania, yekala mrindzi wa mryango wa uphande wa mlairo wa dzuwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seemu yolungira yarekebishwa ni Hanania, mwana wa Shelemia, na Hanuni mwana wa sita wa Zalafu warekebisha seemu yolungira. Seemu yolungira yarekebishwa ni Meshulamu, mwana wa Berekiya, nayo kala i mbere ya nyumbaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seemu yolungira yarekebishwa ni mfuli wa zahabu mmwenga ariyeihwa Malikija. Iye warekebisha hadi kufikira nyumba ya atumishi a nyumba ya kuvoya Mlungu na ya ahendadzi-bishara, yololana na Ryango ra kuchunguzira anajeshi kpwenderera hadi chumba cha dzulu cha pembeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kula hipho hadi Ryango ra Mangʼondzi, ukuta warekebishwa ni afuli a zahabu na ahendadzi-bishara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
